  "content_html": "<html>\n  <body>\n    <h3>macOS</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>macOS 27 Golden Gate (26A428): <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/127257\">What’s new</a>, <a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/macos-release-notes/macos-27-release-notes\">Developer Release Notes</a>, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/149035\">Security</a>, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/148830\">Enterprise</a>, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/127255\">Compatibility</a>, <a href=\"https://updates.cdn-apple.com/2026FallFCS/afcfc88e-bbe6-44bf-a5da-07c56eebc06c/UniversalMac_27.0_26A428_Restore.ipsw\">IPSW</a>, <a href=\"https://swcdn.apple.com/content/downloads/01/05/142-15488-A_9XNIAXWVVL/5ajxcy8xk014o98zz1uut0zrlaj2nx91ln/InstallAssistant.pkg\">Installer PKG</a></li>\n      <li>macOS Tahoe 26.7 (25G229): <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/122868\">What’s new</a>, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/149042\">Security</a></li>\n      <li>macOS Sequoia 15.8 (24H23): <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-ca/120283\">What’s new</a>, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/149043\">Security</a></li>\n    </ul>\n    <h3>iOS and iPadOS</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>iOS 27: About, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/148828\">Enterprise</a></li>\n      <li>iPad OS 27: About, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/148829\">Enterprise</a></li>\n      <li>iOS 26.7: <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/123075\">About</a>, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/125073\">Enterprise</a></li>\n      <li>iPadOS 26.7: <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/123074\">About</a>, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/125074\">Enterprise</a></li>\n      <li>iOS and iPadOS 27: <a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/ios-ipados-release-notes/ios-ipados-27-release-notes\">Developer Release Notes</a></li>\n      <li>Security: <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/149034\">27.0</a>, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/149041\">26.7</a></li>\n    </ul>\n    <h3>Other Platforms</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>visionOS 27: <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/149067\">About</a>, <a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/visionos-release-notes/visionos-27-release-notes\">Developer Release Notes</a>, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/149038\">Security</a>, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/148831\">Enterprise</a></li>\n      <li>watchOS 27: <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/123002\">About</a>, <a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/watchos-release-notes/watchos-27-release-notes\">Developer Release Notes</a>, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/149037\">Security</a></li>\n      <li>tvOS 27: <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/106336\">About</a>, <a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/tvos-release-notes/tvos-27-release-notes\">Developer Release Notes</a>, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/149036\">Security</a></li>\n    </ul>\n    <h3>Applications</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Safari 27: <a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/safari-release-notes/safari-27-release-notes\">Developer Release Notes</a>, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/en-us/149039\">Security</a></li>\n      <li>Xcode 27: <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/xcode/id497799835?l=en&amp;mt=12\">Mac App Store</a>, <a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/download/all/\">Developer Downloads</a>, <a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode-release-notes/xcode-27-release-notes\">Developer Release Notes</a>, <a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode\">Documentation</a></li>\n    </ul>\n    <h3>User Guides</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Apple Business: <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/guide/business/welcome/web\">User Guide</a>, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/guide/business/document-revision-history-axm6344esz8j/web\">Revision history</a></li>\n      <li>\n        <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/guide/mac-help/welcome/mac\">macOS</a>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/guide/iphone/welcome/ios\">iPhone</a>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/guide/ipad/welcome/ipados\">iPad</a>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/guide/watch/welcome/watchos\">Apple Watch</a>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/guide/tv/welcome/tvos\">Apple TV</a>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/guide/apple-vision-pro/welcome/visionos\">Apple Vision Pro</a>\n      </li>\n      <li>Safari: <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/guide/safari/welcome/mac\">Mac</a>, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/guide/iphone/browse-the-web-iph1fbef4daa/ios\">iPhone</a>, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/guide/ipad/browse-the-web-ipad999d68f9/ipados\">iPad</a>, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/safari\">Support</a></li>\n      <li>Shortcuts: <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/guide/shortcuts-mac/welcome/mac\">Mac</a>, <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/guide/shortcuts/welcome/ios\">iPhone and iPad</a></li>\n    </ul>\n  </body>\n</html>",
